Click on brightness/contrast.

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:22.740
Then, in the window that comes up,

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:26.080
adjust said brightness and 
contrast on the image, and...

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:29.090
Brightness/Contrast

