00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:31.800
It's the culprit's face!

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:34.590
Saemon! Make it clearer!

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:35.730
On it!

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.850
Brightness/Contrast

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.850
Brightness:

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.850
