00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.850
Cancel

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.850
Auto

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:38.850
Preview

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:40.850
Ebitani?!

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:42.760
That's Ebitani, isn't it?!

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:44.600
I-I think so.

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:46.090
It makes sense...

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:49.480
A former member of Team 
Tonegawa like Ebitani would

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:52.110
know everything that was 
contained in those tweets.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:55.130
Hey, there's a new tweet!

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:59.370
"The tower of darkness looms above 
us once again today. Black Teiai."

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:04.370
<b>Psst... Psst...</b>

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:02.570
W-Wait, isn't this...

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:04.370
That's in front of the building.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:16.380
There he is!

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:22.480
And that's one for the lulz.

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:23.750
No lulz to be had here.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.750
Tonegawa-sensei...

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:30.150
Ebitani, what you're doing now

00:17:30.640 --> 00:17:33.650
is so pathetic, 
I can't even bring myself to LOL.

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:35.700
How low you've fallen, Ebitani.

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:39.130
To think you were the 
hater this entire time...

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:43.160
Why would you pull this nonsense?

00:17:58.360 --> 00:18:00.430
Sh-Shut up.

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:06.220
This stupid black business
should just fall apart!

00:18:06.220 --> 00:18:10.940
Joining this company was the 
biggest mistake I ever made!

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:16.280
I got fired, had my whole life 
screwed up, and now what do I have?

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:21.440
Nowhere to live, and no money to my name!

00:18:21.440 --> 00:18:24.950
I was just trying to do a good job!

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:30.510
Why the hell does this happen to only me?!

00:18:30.510 --> 00:18:33.710
Everyone! Listen to me!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:36.290
This Teiai Company is a black business

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:40.570
that pushes its good-hearted 
employees so hard that they—

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:39.720
Shut him up.

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:09.160
<i>When he opens his eyes, 
he finds himself in a small room.</i>

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:13.590
<i>In addition to basic necessities 
like a toilet and a sink...</i>

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:16.590
<i>A TV and a Blu-ray deck...</i>

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.090
<b>Along with!</b>

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.090
<i>Along with!</i>

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:22.010
<i>A high-spec PC and an LCD tablet?</i>

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:25.350
You think you can turn your 
life around with whining?

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:33.780
What you've done this time is something 
that no member of Teiai can overlook.

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:38.360
So you'll be forced to make amends.

00:19:42.630 --> 00:19:43.870
What is this?

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:48.870
The log-in address and password for 
the official Teiai Twitter account.

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:53.580
You might be a pitiful piece of trash,

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:58.020
but I'll admit you've got some skill at Twitter.

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:02.680
You're free to go once the follower 
count hits 100,000.

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:07.030
Anime, artwork, cat videos, 
I don't care what you use.

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:10.410
Just keep tweeting for the good of Teiai.

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:30.310
<i>Hi there! There's a new person 
running this account.</i>

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:34.570
<i>From now on, I'm going to be bringing 
you all the news you'll be glad to hear,</i>

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:37.070
<i>so keep those eyes open!</i>

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:39.450
That's right, Ebitani.

00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:41.360
No matter how badly you fail,

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:46.680
all anyone can ever do is take 
things one step at a time...

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:51.190
And build things up, tweet by tweet.

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:57.090
<i>Hang in there, Tonegawa! 
Don't give up, Tonegawa!</i>

00:20:57.910 --> 00:21:02.560
<i>This is the story of a lone man who 
struggles between his employer, the president,</i>

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:06.610
<i>and his own employees, the men in black...</i>

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:10.980
<i>Tonegawa Yukio: Middle Manager!</i>

00:22:46.150 --> 00:22:48.740
<i>He's free to come and go, surprisingly.</i>

00:22:48.740 --> 00:22:49.970
Lul.

00:22:55.380 --> 00:22:57.530
<i>Next time, "Premonition."</i>

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:00.250
<b>Premonition</b>
